zlib-turbo is an altered version of zlib.

It is based on zlib 1.3.2, (C) 1995-2026 Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler, and is not the original zlib. Its
changes are (C) 2026 Yingquan (Cody) Wu and are under the same zlib license (see LICENSE).

The changes are in inffast.c, inflate.c, infback.c, inftrees.h, adler32.c, crc32.c, deflate.c, trees.c and zutil.c,
in the new header zturbo.h, in the build files (zlib.map, win32/zlib.def, CMakeLists.txt, zlibConfig.cmake.in,
configure, Makefile.in, zlib.pc.in), in test/infcover.c, in the new .github/workflows/turbo.yml, and in the turbo/
directory; README.md describes them. zlib.h and zconf.h are unchanged, and zlibVersion() returns the zlib version
zlib-turbo is based on; zlibTurboVersion() returns zlib-turbo's version.
